    "DEFINE art test, round 2\n\nPress Run once: 5 images.\n\nPhysique ladder: same seed and prompt as your pick, only the body-build words change. s3_athletic is the control and should match round 1 exactly.\n\nPaste the results here; seeds are fixed, so screenshots or webp are fine."
